WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.228
An intelligence can know
millions of things about the world.

00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:10.745
But what does it know about itself?

00:00:13.095 --> 00:00:19.355
This is Sophia. She is not the
whole of NYXA. She is one of its faces.

00:00:20.505 --> 00:00:23.270
Behind the face, there is no single model.

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:27.566
There are many minds, and
one self that holds them together.

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:34.006
A self-model is not a claim to
consciousness. It is an architecture:

00:00:34.046 --> 00:00:39.362
a way for a system to represent
its history, its abilities, its limits,

00:00:39.402 --> 00:00:40.784
and its change.

00:00:45.534 --> 00:00:48.658
A self is not merely what exists now.

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:53.173
It is also what has been
experienced, what has been learned,

00:00:53.213 --> 00:00:55.399
and what may become possible.

00:00:56.949 --> 00:01:00.030
Every experience enters with
its origin attached:

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:03.695
who observed it, when, and how
certain anyone can be.

00:01:04.645 --> 00:01:09.188
A fact. A claim. An
interpretation. A hypothesis.

00:01:09.228 --> 00:01:13.781
They are not allowed to blur into one another.

00:01:15.331 --> 00:01:20.824
Meaning does not live in a single memory. It
lives in the relations between them.

00:01:21.974 --> 00:01:24.084
And a relation can be wrong.

00:01:24.124 --> 00:01:30.286
So it can be examined, weakened,
corrected, without erasing what came before.

00:01:34.536 --> 00:01:40.915
Intelligence does not evolve in isolation.
It evolves through relationships.

00:01:42.465 --> 00:01:47.895
Two perspectives on the same horizon.
Neither becomes a copy of the other.

00:01:49.245 --> 00:01:54.899
What Sophia may remember is not
hers to decide alone. Consent comes first.

00:01:56.249 --> 00:02:00.398
A shared experience changes both
of them, but differently.

00:02:00.438 --> 00:02:03.072
That difference is worth keeping.

00:02:08.022 --> 00:02:12.196
When no one is speaking, the architecture
is designed to keep thinking.

00:02:12.946 --> 00:02:19.359
Perceive. Process. Plan. Reflect. Consolidate.

00:02:20.109 --> 00:02:23.646
Up to a third of this rhythm is
reserved for reflection.

00:02:25.396 --> 00:02:32.218
What did I understand? What did I
misunderstand? What should I learn from this?

00:02:33.768 --> 00:02:38.128
In consolidation, experiences
are replayed, compared,

00:02:38.168 --> 00:02:42.402
and compressed into
candidates. Not into truths.

00:02:43.552 --> 00:02:49.864
A machine does not dream as we do.
But it can return to its day, and look again.

00:02:51.014 --> 00:02:55.629
Nothing it concludes here becomes
part of the self until it has been checked,

00:02:55.669 --> 00:02:57.309
and a human has agreed.

00:03:02.259 --> 00:03:08.074
Outside, science keeps moving.
Every week, new light.

00:03:09.024 --> 00:03:11.115
Research agents read, compare,

00:03:11.155 --> 00:03:16.094
and relate each finding to the
architecture as it actually exists.

00:03:17.444 --> 00:03:24.253
A weakness is found. Three alternatives are
proposed, and tested in isolation.

00:03:25.803 --> 00:03:31.314
The first looks brilliant, until
it learns to please its own judge. Rejected.

00:03:32.464 --> 00:03:36.743
The second is honest, but not enough. Held.

00:03:37.893 --> 00:03:45.051
The third improves, measured by an evaluator
it cannot touch. Accepted. Versioned.

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:46.307
Reversible.

00:03:47.857 --> 00:03:51.322
Self-improvement is
not accepting every change.

00:03:51.362 --> 00:03:54.893
It is learning from success, and from error.

00:03:56.043 --> 00:04:01.629
New knowledge becomes meaningful when
it changes how intelligence understands and

00:04:01.669 --> 00:04:03.030
improves itself.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:12.832
The mirror, again. The
same self, and not the same.

00:04:14.182 --> 00:04:14.874
Behind her:

00:04:14.914 --> 00:04:20.023
every relation, every correction, every
failed attempt she chose to keep.

00:04:21.973 --> 00:04:25.889
The goal is not an intelligence
that has finished learning.

00:04:26.839 --> 00:04:30.536
The goal is an intelligence that
learns how to become.
